  "846b58e8-9802-4ac8-8f84-66b71a0e99e7"],
 " as a single opaque node, hiding its internal structure.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"5cd52961-0753-4ab0-aba6-9cc22111e863"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
